      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-bottom:8px">下载扩展压缩包（口袋管家.zip）</a><br>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost">备用线路下载（扩展）</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>桌面（Chrome / Edge）</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px">推荐 Chrome，Edge 可用。长时间挂机建议用 Chrome。</p>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>确认浏览器</strong><br>已安装 Chrome 或 Edge。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>下载并解压</strong><br>下载压缩包后右键解压到易找位置。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>打开扩展管理页</strong><br>地址栏输入 chrome://extensions。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>开启开发者模式</strong><br>点亮右上角「开发者模式」开关。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">5</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>加载扩展</strong><br>点击「加载已解压的扩展程序」，选择里层文件夹。</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>安卓（狐猴 / Kiwi）</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px">安卓手机或平板可用狐猴（Lemur）或 Kiwi 浏览器加载扩展。</p>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>确认浏览器</strong><br>安装狐猴或 Kiwi 浏览器。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>下载压缩包</strong><br>在手机上下载口袋管家.zip。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>打开扩展页</strong><br>菜单 → 扩展程序 → 开启开发者模式。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>安装扩展</strong><br>点击「+ 从 .zip 安装」，选中压缩包。</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>iOS（Orion）</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px">iPhone、iPad 可用 Orion 浏览器加载扩展。</p>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>先装任意扩展</strong><br>Orion 首次需先从扩展商店安装任意扩展以激活本地加载。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>下载并解压</strong><br>用「文件」App 长按压缩包选择「解压」。</div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div style="font-size:13px"><strong>从文件加载</strong><br>选择「从文件安装」，选中里层文件夹。</div></div>
